  "_comment_ride_height": "M4 ride heights (4f item 1, author ruling 2026-10-23): high speed only, all phases; nose down -> more front, less rear downforce (Katz pp. 170-172, Fig. 5.26 pitch sensitivity). The direction holds outside the ground-effect stall regime; TE Tab. 5.11 p. 293 (front ride height up against sudden push) is the stall case (Katz Fig. 5.26, viscous effect at very low clearance). That is why MM p. 573 and TE Tab. 5.11 seemed to contradict (the earlier reason for excluding ride heights). Step 1 mm (registry adjustment_step)."
}
